<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>頤典｜診所管理後台 v4</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/pilot/assets/pilot.css">
  <script src="/pilot/assets/pilot.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
<div class="demo-ribbon"><strong>公版管理 v4</strong><span>山林原後台為正式資料來源；頤典獨立本機試行，尚未開通 Firebase</span></div>
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="header-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="/pilot"><span class="brand-mark">✚</span><span>頤典 <small>DOUBTS / Clinic Platform</small></span></a>
    <nav class="head-actions" aria-label="主要導覽">
      <button id="navClinics" class="plain-button">切換診所</button>
      <button id="navHome" class="plain-button">診所前台</button>
      <button id="navAdmin" class="outline-button">診所管理後台</button>
      <button id="navPlatform" class="plain-button">頤典平台管理</button>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
<main class="page-shell">
  <section id="chooser" class="chooser">
    <div class="eyebrow">MULTI-TENANT PILOT</div>
    <h1>同一套診所管理系統，服務兩家診所</h1>
    <p class="lead">選擇診所，使用相同的後台管理基本資料、科別與醫師、預約設定及 Excel 健檢目錄。</p>
    <div class="clinic-grid">
      <button class="clinic-choice" data-select-clinic="shanlin"><span class="clinic-icon">✚</span><strong>山林診所</strong><span>合作診所｜試行環境</span><em>進入示範網站 →</em></button>
      <button class="clinic-choice" data-select-clinic="yidian"><span class="clinic-icon">✚</span><strong>頤典診所</strong><span>公版展示｜Excel 匯入驗證</span><em>進入示範網站 →</em></button>
    </div>
    <div class="setup-callout"><strong>平台開通管理</strong><p>頤典平台總管理員可在此建立頤典診所帳號。山林既有密碼不在本平台重新建立。</p><button id="chooserPlatform" class="outline-button">進入平台管理員後台</button></div>
    <p class="small-note">本階段先完成公版診所自助設定與獨立權限；山林原預約後台保留，頤典的正式預約 API、Firebase 仍需完成介接。</p>
  </section>

  <section id="clinicView" hidden>
    <div class="hero">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">頤典智慧健檢預約平台 · 公版展示</span>
        <h1 id="publicClinicName">診所名稱</h1>
        <p id="publicIntro">請選擇服務。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-logo">✚</div>
    </div>
    <div class="split-sections">
      <section class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head"><h2>診所基本資料</h2><span class="chip">此頁依診所設定顯示</span></div>
        <div class="info-grid"><div><small>聯絡電話</small><strong id="publicPhone">尚未設定</strong></div><div><small>地址</small><strong id="publicAddress">尚未設定</strong></div><div><small>服務時間</small><strong id="publicHours">尚未設定</strong></div><div><small>交通資訊</small><strong id="publicDirections">尚未設定</strong></div></div>
      </section>
      <section class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head"><h2>預約管理</h2><span class="chip">依診所登入權限</span></div>
        <div id="publicAppointmentEntry" class="service-entry">
          <strong>診所專屬預約服務</strong>
          <p>目前公版的基本資料與自費項目已可獨立設定；實際預約仍依診所既有的預約系統管理。</p>
          <button id="publicAdminEntry" type="button" class="primary-button">登入本診所管理後台</button>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
    <section class="panel catalog-public">
      <div class="panel-head"><div><h2>自費健康檢查目錄</h2><p>山林可唯讀預覽原網站的健檢項目；公版草稿必須經診所核對才可另行發布。</p></div><span class="chip" id="catalogBadge">未發布</span></div>
      <div id="publicCatalog"></div>
    </section>
    <section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>科別與醫師</h2><span class="chip">由診所自行維護</span></div><div id="publicMedicalStaff" class="staff-public"></div></section>
  </section>

  <section id="adminLogin" class="admin-login" hidden>
    <div class="login-shell">
      <div class="eyebrow">CLINIC ADMIN</div>
      <h1 id="adminLoginTitle">診所管理員登入</h1>
      <p id="clinicLoginNote">使用診所專屬帳號及密碼登入，僅能管理所屬診所的資料。</p>
      <form id="loginForm"><label>登入帳號<input id="adminUsername" type="text" maxlength="80" autocomplete="username" required placeholder="例如 yidian_admin"></label><label>管理密碼<input id="adminPassword" type="password" minlength="12" autocomplete="current-password" required placeholder="輸入管理密碼"></label><button class="primary-button" type="submit">登入診所管理後台</button></form>
      <p class="small-note">頤典診所由平台總管理員開通。山林不需新增密碼，但須確認原登入 API 可在本機 8000／8001 驗證；若尚未確認，請先使用原本的 admin.html 預約後台。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="platformLogin" class="admin-login" hidden>
    <div class="login-shell">
      <div class="eyebrow">PLATFORM ADMIN</div>
      <h1>頤典平台總管理員登入</h1>
      <p>只有平台開發團隊可使用。登入後能建立及管理診所帳號，但不會自動取得診所病患資料。</p>
      <form id="platformLoginForm">
        <label>平台管理帳號<input id="platformUsername" type="text" minlength="4" maxlength="64" autocomplete="username" required></label>
        <label>平台管理密碼<input id="platformPassword" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="256" autocomplete="current-password" required></label>
        <button class="primary-button" type="submit">登入平台管理後台</button>
      </form>
      <p class="small-note">平台第一組帳密由本機 Terminal 首次開通；不提供網頁公開註冊。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="platformView" hidden>
    <div class="admin-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">PLATFORM CONTROL</div><h1>頤典平台｜診所開通管理</h1><p>同一套公版，依帳號確認診所權限。平台管理員不直接存取病患預約內容。</p></div><div class="admin-top-actions"><span class="chip">本機展示管理</span><button class="outline-button" id="platformLogout">登出平台</button></div></div>
    <section class="panel">
      <div class="panel-head"><div><h2>目前啟用的兩家診所</h2><p>山林沿用舊後台驗證；頤典由平台總管理員建立新帳號。</p></div></div>
      <div id="platformClinicRows" class="platform-clinics" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </section>
    <section class="panel">
      <div class="panel-head"><div><h2>開通／重設頤典診所管理帳號</h2><p>由頤典平台管理員指定帳號及初始密碼，第一次登入必須修改密碼。</p></div></div>
      <form id="provisionForm" class="settings-form">
        <label>頤典診所登入帳號<input id="newClinicUsername" type="text" minlength="4" maxlength="64" autocomplete="off" required placeholder="例如 yidian_admin"></label>
        <div class="two-inputs"><label>初始密碼（至少 12 字元）<input id="newClinicPassword" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="256" autocomplete="new-password" required></label>
        <label>再輸入一次初始密碼<input id="confirmClinicPassword" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="256" autocomplete="new-password" required></label></div>
        <div class="form-footer"><button class="primary-button" type="submit" id="provisionBtn">建立頤典診所帳號</button><span class="small-note">如已開通，再次建立需要確認「重設」，原登入階段會立即失效。</span></div>
      </form>
    </section>
    <div id="platformFirebaseNotice" class="source-note" role="status">頤典目前沒有獨立 Firebase；開通帳號不代表已開通資料庫。請勿填入山林的 Firebase 憑證。</div>
    <p class="small-note">本機試行版不會寫入原山林 Firebase，也不修改原本的山林帳密。僅顯示帳號開通狀態，不展示密碼。</p>
  </section>

  <section id="changePasswordView" class="admin-login" hidden>
    <div class="login-shell">
      <div class="eyebrow">FIRST LOGIN</div><h1>變更頤典診所初始密碼</h1>
      <p>為避免長期使用平台人員交付的初始密碼，第一次登入須先設定自己的密碼。</p>
      <form id="changePasswordForm">
        <label>目前的初始密碼<input type="password" id="oldClinicPassword" autocomplete="current-password" required></label>
        <label>新的管理密碼<input type="password" id="newClinicOwnPassword" minlength="12" maxlength="256" autocomplete="new-password" required></label>
        <label>再次確認新密碼<input type="password" id="newClinicOwnPassword2" minlength="12" maxlength="256" autocomplete="new-password" required></label>
        <button class="primary-button" type="submit">更新密碼並重新登入</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="adminView" hidden>
    <div class="admin-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">CLINIC CONSOLE</div><h1 id="adminTitle">診所管理後台</h1><p id="adminIntro">由診所自行維護科別醫師與 Excel 健檢目錄。</p></div><div class="admin-top-actions"><span id="adminStorage" class="chip"></span><button id="logoutBtn" class="outline-button">登出</button></div></div>
    <nav class="admin-subnav" aria-label="診所設定導覽">
      <button type="button" class="active" data-admin-pane="overview">總覽</button>
      <button type="button" data-admin-pane="clinic">診所基本資料</button>
      <button type="button" data-admin-pane="staff">科別與醫師</button>
      <button type="button" data-admin-pane="catalog">自費健檢目錄</button>
      <button type="button" data-admin-pane="appointments">預約管理</button>
    </nav>
    <div id="overviewPane" class="admin-pane">
      <div class="metric-row"><div><small>已設定科別</small><strong id="metricDepartments">0</strong></div><div><small>草稿項目</small><strong id="metricDraft">0</strong></div><div><small>已發布於公版</small><strong id="metricPublished">0</strong></div><div id="metricOriginalWrap" hidden><small>山林原站項目（唯讀）</small><strong id="metricOriginal">—</strong></div></div>
      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>系統整合狀態</h2><span class="chip">以實際連線為準</span></div><div id="integrationSummary" role="status">正在檢查來源資料…</div><div class="status-note">目前只確認公版設定 API 可使用，並不代表預約系統、Firebase 或原山林病歷系統已成功串接。</div></section>
      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>設定待辦</h2></div><div id="setupChecklist"></div></section>
    </div>
    <section class="panel admin-pane" id="clinicPane" hidden>
      <div class="panel-head"><div><h2>診所基本資料與預約時段</h2><p>山林只在原預約後台修改；頤典由這個公版後台自行維護，避免重複填寫。</p></div></div>
      <div id="shanlinConfigNotice" class="source-note" hidden>
        <strong>山林診所：只顯示原預約後台資料，不必再填一次。</strong>
        <p id="shanlinConfigDetail">登入後會嘗試從 8001 讀取原後台設定。</p>
        <a class="outline-button" href="http://127.0.0.1:5500/admin.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">開啟山林原後台修改基本資料 ↗</a>
        <span class="small-note">若剛修改原後台，請重新登入此公版，取得新的唯讀快照。</span>
      </div>
      <form id="configForm" class="settings-form">
        <fieldset id="cfgEditable" class="clean-fieldset">
        <div class="two-inputs"><label>診所名稱<input id="cfgName" maxlength="80" placeholder="例如：頤典診所" required></label><label>電話<input id="cfgPhone" maxlength="60" placeholder="例如：02-2933-2010"></label></div>
        <div class="two-inputs"><label>診所地址<input id="cfgAddress" maxlength="250" placeholder="請輸入完整地址，例如：臺北市文山區○○路○號"></label><label>交通資訊<input id="cfgDirections" maxlength="500" placeholder="例如：由捷運站步行約 3 分鐘"></label></div>
        <label>服務時間<textarea id="cfgHours" rows="3" maxlength="800" placeholder="例如：週一至週五 08:30–12:30、13:30–17:30；週日休診"></textarea></label>
        <label>簡短介紹<textarea id="cfgIntro" rows="2" maxlength="600" placeholder="請簡述診所特色、科別及健檢服務"></textarea></label>
        <div class="two-inputs"><label>可預約日期（每行一個 YYYY-MM-DD）<textarea id="cfgDates" rows="4" placeholder="每行一個日期
例如：2026-11-02"></textarea></label><label>預約時段（每行一個 HH:MM）<textarea id="cfgTimes" rows="4" placeholder="每行一個時段
例如：08:00"></textarea></label></div>
        </fieldset>
        <p id="configSourceNote" class="small-note">此頁僅維護頤典的 8005 本機展示設定；尚未接入正式預約或 Firebase。</p>
        <div class="form-footer"><button type="submit" class="primary-button" id="saveConfigBtn">儲存診所基本資料</button><span id="configStatus" role="status"></span></div>
      </form>
    </section>
    <section class="panel admin-pane" id="catalogPane" hidden>
      <div class="panel-head"><div><h2>自費健檢目錄｜匯入 Excel</h2><p>辨識不同欄位順序、名稱、工作表與套組；價格有疑義的項目需核對。</p></div><span class="chip">人工審核後發布</span></div>
      <section id="shanlinSourcePanel" class="source-panel" hidden>
        <div class="panel-head"><div><h3>山林原預約網站｜既有健檢項目（唯讀）</h3><p>直接讀取 <code>website/自費項目對話資料庫.json</code> 的實際項目及價格，不是空白範本，也不會改動原網站。</p></div><span class="chip" id="sourceCatalogBadge">檢查中</span></div>
        <div id="sourceCatalogSummary" class="summary-line" role="status">正在檢查原資料檔…</div>
        <div class="import-bar"><button id="reloadSourceCatalogBtn" class="outline-button" type="button">重新讀取原網站資料</button><button id="copySourceToDraftBtn" class="primary-button" type="button" disabled>複製為公版待核對草稿</button></div>
        <details id="sourceCatalogDetails"><summary>查看原網站項目及價格（僅供核對）</summary><div id="sourceCatalogItems" class="source-items"></div></details>
        <p class="small-note">來源清單與 8005 草稿是兩套不同資料；「複製」僅建立編輯草稿。公版發布不會寫回山林原本的自費加購網站。</p>
      </section>
      <p class="small-note">可以上傳診所既有的 Excel（欄位名稱及順序可不同）。系統會先預覽與標註價格疑義，診所人員核對後才可發布。</p>
      <div class="import-bar"><label class="upload-button">選取 Excel (.xlsx)<input id="excelFile" type="file" accept=".xlsx"></label><button id="saveDraftBtn" class="outline-button" disabled>儲存草稿</button><button id="publishBtn" class="primary-button" disabled>發布已核對的項目</button><button id="downloadDraftBtn" class="plain-button" disabled>下載草稿 JSON</button></div>
      <div id="importSummary" class="summary-line" role="status">尚未匯入健檢價目表。</div>
      <p class="small-note">價格為 Excel 公式、合併套組或科別推測時，必須人工核對。發布僅更新 8005 公版預覽，不會更新原 5500/8000 的正式自費選單。</p>
      <div class="list-tools"><input id="searchItems" type="search" placeholder="搜尋檢查項目 / 原始群組"><select id="filterItems"><option value="all">全部項目</option><option value="enabled">待發布（已啟用）</option><option value="issues">價格待確認</option></select></div>
      <div id="editCatalog" class="edit-catalog"></div>
    </section>
    <section class="panel admin-pane" id="staffPane" hidden>
      <div class="panel-head"><div><h2>科別與醫師資料</h2><p>診所人員自行新增、移除科別及醫師；儲存後顯示在本診所前台。</p></div></div>
      <div class="editor-layout">
        <div class="soft-panel"><h3>管理科別</h3><div class="inline-fields"><input id="newDepartmentName" maxlength="50" placeholder="例如：家醫科" aria-label="科別名稱"><button type="button" id="addDepartmentBtn" class="primary-button">新增科別</button></div><div id="departmentList" class="managed-list"></div></div>
        <div class="soft-panel"><h3>管理醫師</h3><label>醫師姓名<input id="newPhysicianName" maxlength="60" placeholder="例如：陳醫師"></label><label>所屬科別<select id="newPhysicianDepartment"></select></label><label>職稱／備註（選填）<input id="newPhysicianTitle" maxlength="70" placeholder="例如：主治醫師"></label><button type="button" id="addPhysicianBtn" class="primary-button">新增醫師</button><div id="physicianList" class="managed-list"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-footer"><button id="saveStaffBtn" type="button" class="primary-button">儲存科別與醫師</button><span id="staffStatus" role="status"></span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="panel admin-pane" id="appointmentsPane" hidden>
      <div class="panel-head"><div><h2>預約管理</h2><p>山林仍由原 admin.html 管理實際預約；頤典尚未建立正式預約 API 或 Firebase。</p></div></div>
      <div id="appointmentIntegration" class="status-panel" role="status"></div>
      <div class="form-footer"><a href="http://127.0.0.1:5500/admin.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="primary-button" id="openLegacyAdmin" hidden>前往原山林預約後台</a><button type="button" id="refreshIntegrationBtn" class="outline-button">重新檢查狀態</button></div>
    </section>
  </section>
  <div id="notification" class="notification" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
</main>
<footer class="foot">頤典 DOUBTS · 科技，讓醫療更有溫度 · 雙診所公版試行 · 僅供展示</footer>
</body>
</html>
